<Doc title="Affiliate disclosure" lede="How this site makes money, in plain English.">
  <p>The Biological Edge earns money in two ways.</p>
  <h2>1. Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Some links to products on this site are affiliate links. If you click one and buy something, the retailer may pay us a commission. You pay the same price either way.</p>
  <p>Affiliate links are labelled where they appear. A commission never decides what makes the list: products are chosen first, and we look for an affiliate programme afterwards. Where no programme exists, we link to the product anyway.</p>
  <h2>2. Our own guides and programs</h2>
  <p>We sell our own digital products directly on this site. When you buy one, you are buying from us.</p>
  <h2>What we don't do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We don't accept payment for positive reviews.</li>
    <li>We don't sell or advertise prescription medication.</li>
    <li>We don't publish testimonials we can't verify.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@thebiologicaledge.com">hello@thebiologicaledge.com</a>.</p>
</Doc>
